{
  "uid": "rcaldas-seguranca",
  "title": "Segurança — firewall, SSH e fail2ban",
  "description": "Quem esta batendo na porta e em quais portas. Fonte: regra LIMBO do nftables (kernel, via journal), sshd e fail2ban. LEIA: o log do firewall e' AMOSTRA (limit rate 100/minute); pra censo exato de pacotes use o counter da propria regra no nft.",
  "tags": ["rcaldas", "seguranca", "firewall"],
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pacotes dropados (amostra)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "IPs de origem distintos",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "count(count by (src) (count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` | regexp `SRC=(?P<src>[0-9.]+)` [$__range])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tentativas de auth SSH (frota)",
      "description": "Cobre a frota inteira, nao so' o us -- e no `us` isto tende a ficar em ZERO de proposito: a chain do nftables nao tem regra `tcp dport 22 accept`, entao o SSH da internet e' dropado antes de chegar no sshd (o acesso real e' pela 8422). As 12.365 tentativas na porta 22 vistas em 7 dias aparecem no painel de firewall, nunca aqui.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=~\"sshd.*\"} |~ `Failed password|Invalid user|invalid user` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "IPs banidos reincidindo",
      "description": "IPs distintos que o fail2ban voltou a detectar DEPOIS de ja te-los banido. Medido em 23/08/2026: 2.531 linhas 'already banned' em 24h contra ZERO bans novos. Se este numero for alto e o de bans novos for zero, vale investigar se a acao de ban esta de fato bloqueando o trafego -- um ban efetivo deveria fazer o IP parar de gerar linha nova.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "none" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "count(count by (ip) (count_over_time({service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `already banned` | regexp `(?P<ip>\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+)` [$__range])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pacotes dropados por minuto",
      "description": "Teto de 100/min pela regra. Se a linha encostar em 100 e ficar reta, o log saturou e virou amostra truncada -- o numero real e' maior.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never" },
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 95 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "drops/min",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` [1m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Top 8 portas alvo — tendencia",
      "description": "Porta que aparece de repente e nao existia antes costuma ser CVE nova sendo varrida em massa. Vale conferir a que servico ela corresponde.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" }, "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "{{proto}}/{{dpt}}",
          "expr": "topk(8, sum by (proto, dpt) (count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` | regexp `PROTO=(?P<proto>\\S+) SPT=\\d+ DPT=(?P<dpt>\\d+)` [10m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Portas mais tentadas no periodo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Value", "desc": true }] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (dpt) (count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` | regexp `DPT=(?P<dpt>\\d+)` [$__range])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "IPs de origem mais insistentes",
      "description": "Um IP com MUITAS tentativas numa porta SO' costuma ser cliente legitimo sendo bloqueado, nao ataque -- foi assim que se descobriu a 21114 do RustDesk. Ataque tende a espalhar por varias portas ou vir de varios IPs vizinhos.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Value", "desc": true }] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (src, dpt) (count_over_time({host=\"us\", service=\"kernel\"} |= `LIMBO` | regexp `SRC=(?P<src>[0-9.]+)` | regexp `DPT=(?P<dpt>\\d+)` [$__range])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Atividade do fail2ban por jail",
      "description": "Duas series: A = deteccoes de IP ja banido (o volume real hoje), B = bans novos. Se A cresce e B fica em zero, o fail2ban esta vendo os mesmos IPs de novo em vez de barra-los.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Value #A", "desc": true }] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (jail) (count_over_time({service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `already banned` | regexp `\\[(?P<jail>[^\\]]+)\\]` [$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (jail) (count_over_time({service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `\\] Ban ` | regexp `\\[(?P<jail>[^\\]]+)\\]` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Auth SSH falha × atividade do fail2ban",
      "description": "Tres linhas: falha de auth SSH na frota, bans NOVOS, e re-deteccoes de IP ja banido. O padrao saudavel e' ban novo acompanhando a falha. O padrao medido em 23/08 foi o oposto: zero ban novo e 2.531 re-deteccoes, o que sugere que a acao de ban pode nao estar bloqueando de fato.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" }, "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "auth SSH falha",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=~\"sshd.*\"} |~ `Failed password|Invalid user|invalid user` [5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "bans novos",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `\\] Ban ` [5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "re-deteccao (ja banido)",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `already banned` [5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Atividade recente do fail2ban",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{service=\"fail2ban\"} |~ `(?i)\\b(ban|unban)`"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
